      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm looking into some premature longitudinal cracking on a new asphalt section we laid out in Phoenix last year. Can you give me a summary of the primary technical causes for this kind of pavement failure, specifically regarding thermal expansion and bitumen viscosity?",
